    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELL...HERE YOU ARE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up to silence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is here. You can\u2019t see it, but you can feel it. It watches. It waits. And it hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base, once a haven on the moon's surface, is now a labyrinth of flickering lights, groaning metal, and half-seen horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/5d04d37c67076e5ac9eb593f8860ddf1.avif?t=1746616813\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is a gamble, every corner hides the unknown. Your only tools are your instincts and what little you can scavenge along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outwit the unseen predator? Can you escape the decaying moonbase before it collapses completely? Or will you be another silent victim of the creature lurking in the shadows?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Survival Horror:</strong> Every playthrough is different with a procedurally generated maze that keeps you on edge. No run is the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Atmosphere:</strong> 3D visuals with a retro-inspired dithering effect immerse you in a chilling, timeless aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Tension:</strong> Limited visibility and environmental storytelling put you in the center of the fear. Every sound, every flicker of light, becomes a potential threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Nerves:</strong> It\u2019s not just about finding your way out\u2014it\u2019s about staying alive long enough to escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.poster.avif?t=1746616813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.webm?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.mp4?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.poster.avif?t=1746616813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.webm?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.mp4?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELL...HERE YOU ARE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up to silence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is here. You can\u2019t see it, but you can feel it. It watches. It waits. And it hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base, once a haven on the moon's surface, is now a labyrinth of flickering lights, groaning metal, and half-seen horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/5d04d37c67076e5ac9eb593f8860ddf1.avif?t=1746616813\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is a gamble, every corner hides the unknown. Your only tools are your instincts and what little you can scavenge along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outwit the unseen predator? Can you escape the decaying moonbase before it collapses completely? Or will you be another silent victim of the creature lurking in the shadows?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Survival Horror:</strong> Every playthrough is different with a procedurally generated maze that keeps you on edge. No run is the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Atmosphere:</strong> 3D visuals with a retro-inspired dithering effect immerse you in a chilling, timeless aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Tension:</strong> Limited visibility and environmental storytelling put you in the center of the fear. Every sound, every flicker of light, becomes a potential threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Nerves:</strong> It\u2019s not just about finding your way out\u2014it\u2019s about staying alive long enough to escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.poster.avif?t=1746616813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.webm?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/276f29113366c759864723a2555a6a82.mp4?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.poster.avif?t=1746616813\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.webm?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636910/extras/dd52a717a8076850713318c9473b31c7.mp4?t=1746616813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The base is silent\u2014as if abandoned. The air feels heavy, and oxygen is running out. In the shadows, something stirs. You can hear it, but you can\u2019t see it. Every step echoes in the darkness, every sound makes your pulse race. Survive. Escape. Before time runs out.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German, Russian, French, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cAs I crouched in a corner, my heart beating so loud that it was a miracle the monster wasn\u2019t tracking me from that alone, I couldn\u2019t help but think, \u201cGod, this rules.\u201d\u201d<br />\r\nTheGamer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201c\u6697\u304c\u308a\u3068\u30e2\u30ce\u30c8\u30fc\u30f3\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u3067\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u8eab\u4f53\u304c\u30cf\u30c3\u30ad\u30ea\u898b\u3048\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3053\u305d\u6016\u3044\u3057\uff0c\u4eba\u9593\u3063\u307d\u3044\u5b87\u5b99\u670d\u304c\u4eba\u9593\u3089\u3057\u304f\u306a\u3044\u52d5\u304d\u3067\u3053\u3061\u3089\u306b\u8feb\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308b\u306e\u3082\u6050\u308d\u3057\u3044\u306e\u3060\u3002\u201d<br />\r\n4Gamer.net<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201c\u672c\u4f5c\u96d6\u7136\u662f\u5145\u6eff\u672a\u4f86\u611f\u7684\u80cc\u666f\u8a2d\u5b9a\uff0c\u4f46\u4ee5\u5fa9\u53e4\u7684\u50cf\u7d20\u98a8\u683c\u5448\u73fe\uff0c\u53cd\u800c\u6709\u7a2e\u65e9\u671f\u592a\u7a7a\u6050\u6016\u7247\u7684\u611f\u89ba\u3002\u73a9\u5bb6\u5c07\u4ee5\u7b2c\u4e00\u4eba\u7a31\u8996\u89d2\u63a2\u7d22\u57fa\u5730\u5167\u90e8\uff0c\u5728\u6709\u9650\u7684\u8996\u89d2\u4e2d\uff0c\u98a8\u5439\u8349\u52d5\u90fd\u80fd\u5e36\u4f86\u58d3\u8feb\u611f\u201d<br />\r\n4Gamers-Taiwan<br />\r\n",
